#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:5
#: 403fe7f5e8be47608f5e653379bef74e 49e33b4e08ba41ba8bed0c1e400542d2
#: 921a515071ea4e21a8f0c03c0c53e0a0 c06c8e012f0d418f88d0bc689f4acd5d
#: c40ba2adf7e84f8cb66d5858f4514dcc
msgid "GPS - How it Works"
msgstr "GPS - 工作原理"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:7
#: 226d1ecb326244dca60ee6129c40d0b0 2e11a335d5b6413081015ba0e7ba293c
#: 5c3872c1f2d849119e9391e69c923ade cc608a2ea4e844348cfd3a3c043a818c
#: f0fe5173e59d456586f7f3401859c710
msgid "GPS system is a Global Navigation Satellite System (GNSS)."
msgstr "GPS 系统是一种全球导航卫星系统（GNSS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:12
#: 4dbe7c072524415d843fd0cba8b02d7a 68b06fb1e4ce49369d884338d869f3bc
#: 6c057d54a00544e5917568cb5881a3f8 82b1a6a972f242b8b673b9557297c16f
#: a6a39dae12e94c388947c140763ec348
msgid ""
"Most civil GPS receivers are using pseudorange data (C/A code) available on "
"GPS L1 channel (1575.42 MHz) and optionally they can receive SBAS DGPS "
"corrections giving meter precision."
msgstr ""
"大多数民用 GPS 接收机使用 GPS L1 频道（1575.42 MHz）上的伪距数据（C/A 码），也可选择接收 SBAS DGPS "
"校正，从而实现米级精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:19
#: 095740c09786470cafcd0fb61c20c908 74f510e3a28e4cb9acf502d85c392bfb
#: 826c8b91dcdf440d91fc4d0cce7dd9cb 834c54799ac44d45891a685e951f21de
#: a87e3d08754a4788b7a4cdffbd8e3bef
msgid ""
"Advanced and expensive civil GPS receivers can use the previous method plus "
"carrier phase smoothing, carrier phase corrections (RTK) as well as L2 "
"channel P(Y) code semi-codeless tracking (1227.60 MHz) for realtime local "
"ionospheric corrections giving centimeter or even millimeter precision."
msgstr ""
"高级昂贵的民用 GPS 接收机可在上述方法基础上，增加载波相位平滑、载波相位校正（RTK）以及 L2 频道 P(Y) 码半无码跟踪（1227.60 "
"MHz）以实现实时本地电离层校正，从而达到厘米甚至毫米级精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:28
#: c3ff4a6607f04e64934146f6d9725390
msgid ""
"Some even more advanced GNSS receivers can combine DGPS and RTK corrections "
"and can receive other GNSS satellite constellations (GLONASS and GALILEO) "
"and other channels (L2C, L5...) at the same time to enhance precision and "
"fix reliability."
msgstr ""
"一些更先进的 GNSS 接收机可同时结合 DGPS 和 RTK 校正，并同时接收其他 GNSS 卫星星座（GLONASS 和 "
"GALILEO）及其他频段（L2C、L5 等），以提升精度和定位可靠性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:32
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:33
#: 338fa41606d341f097611cc154fddd83 40e0dcdf2c634a2aa6ac8b6c0a689469
#: 6bad21d60d934e71957b2d49d5542f69 ceae00f561cf4b10b014b349098f9104
#: e8dac517aede44f4ac318c8658c824c6
msgid ""
"Military GPS receivers are able to decode the P(Y) code available on L1 and "
"L2 channels giving ten times more precision in realtime compared to a "
"pseudorange basic solution."
msgstr "军用 GPS 接收机能够解码 L1 和 L2 频道上的 P(Y) 码，与伪距基础方案相比，实时精度可提升十倍。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:37
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:38
#: 5fc6c1c3e6aa46f58552454db925ba37 8375c324206345788969215c561075d1
#: 88ea0e173f6c47e3a074f38a8fe2439e b405274e10484923a1af03fde49fa5bd
#: c7c6dfd987fb4b16b021f0a884502de4
msgid "GPS multipathing"
msgstr "GPS 多径效应"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:39
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:40
#: 0498cf48aa5b4b778b2bc45899f9a418 0ce1c9d59b9d4d1796a20f78f86d071c
#: 0dda582bcfdd46edb07a8fa0af6dcc94 3e365ef368474134b76d09bb41b0f9b8
#: e160551b60954a418a436ae9198d0337
msgid ""
"Multipathing is causing GPS position errors that are difficult to detect and"
" compensate for. Multiple GNSS receivers are better suited to filter out "
"multipathing thanks to a higher number of visible satellites at the same "
"time."
msgstr "多径效应会导致难以检测和补偿的 GPS 定位误差。多 GNSS 接收机由于同时可见卫星数量更多，更适合过滤多径效应。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:57
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:58
#: 1974fdf593b44999976b15a6bc7fc5e9 24cca9ec47424c63a4abb89711c9cfac
#: 659417a77eda4e86acb5b265678676a2 caceaa7d24e54e47a1a60c59305275d4
#: e3cf49d9708b4c0c9c049379e26e5afc
msgid "GPS disturbed signal propagation"
msgstr "GPS 信号传播干扰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:59
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:60
#: 0169c90934cb42478120f378a9cce8fb 44201e2958f240ecb8c9533080bc894d
#: 5d18d9e34ca04e078078fdfaf1747d2f 82c978e4014d4d9eba33bc74b15f6863
#: f6a58f1281394fcd963121b18443df0e
msgid ""
"Ionospheric perturbations and magnetic storms (solar activity) can cause "
"signal delays. This can be partially compensated using SBAS and L1 / L2 "
"decoding."
msgstr "电离层扰动和磁暴（太阳活动）可导致信号延迟。可通过 SBAS 和 L1/L2 解码进行部分补偿。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:69
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:70
#: 171c4fdda6a44da68b8b433a8cd91ede 76e22a5f6cde4fcb92567873870d91e3
#: b2b7a02ee38d4f5a9921173547bee423 b8c6aacc81fe41bf8701f4d34df87b8b
#: b9c72afc3b7d46edb0a81f7d17769fa2
msgid ""
"Decoding L1 and L2 channels at the same time do allow realtime ionospheric "
"corrections through a differential technique. Unlike SBAS broadcasted "
"ionospheric corrections, this method gives a better match to local "
"ionospheric conditions."
msgstr "同时解码 L1 和 L2 频道可通过差分技术实现实时电离层校正。与 SBAS 广播的电离层校正相比，该方法能更好地匹配本地电离层条件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:77
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:78
#: 2ccbae473bc6428781dbad2ca3b6e9df 54cdb097d59d484eb9226a663fed3bec
#: 9bf48fc48e514bb68954df03e940b3d9 e46da083efc44110a9b54a8346398484
#: faa5af7a9f0a48f3a493e54deaec7287
msgid ""
"New channels (L2C, L5) for civil use will enhance signal acquisition and "
"position precision as soon as new satellites constellations will be complete"
" ( 2015 - 2020 )."
msgstr "面向民用的新频道（L2C、L5）将在新卫星星座完整建成后（2015—2020 年）增强信号捕获能力和定位精度。"

