#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:101
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:102
#: 2a8b99efa1064aa498b8de8f1a36b67a 3024efa60df74d099d267a58dd45f8c0
#: 9cd0e823ee5143a28d715524d3edea6e b59130fea69b4b39b3e227d3a61b3009
#: f4518eb1629149c6bd93e7d186a22812
msgid "DGPS corrections"
msgstr "DGPS 校正"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:103
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:104
#: 00582d54ebad456d914fc236bda42e10 6aeefcd0e3bc4944bca2e3c20fb45afc
#: 77ccaf453caf460eb2f2ae4c337992d3 8f6b62faa4134e069fb20cd90d4c1d10
#: f880971965f044f493163d40c83adb4c
msgid ""
"DGPS corrections are using pseudorange data only. SBAS is a form of DGPS "
"correction freely available from one or more geostationary satellites."
msgstr "DGPS 校正仅使用伪距数据。SBAS 是一种可从一个或多个地球静止卫星免费获取的 DGPS 校正形式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:106
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:107
#: ac5cdef9b74f4ddb8985c0b6a7593139 d0d083baf0bc460292ce7bfd9ee3ec3f
#: d226ae9729364cc0b47ae049b7be972a e8ac116ae95a434a8115f5d6bff31507
#: f912b66392cd4abca14dd5939f95fa7e
msgid ""
"Each region of the world has a localized SBAS system : WAAS for America, "
"EGNOS for Europe, MSAS for Japan."
msgstr "全球各地区均有本地化 SBAS 系统：北美为 WAAS，欧洲为 EGNOS，日本为 MSAS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:109
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:110
#: 11461eadc6444d9da5718fcca2a6e15f 66e0927b99774b2f94014c76afb9e3d9
#: 6771d5d5e98c4810b0eb8f2400e43dc2 8e1fbb13faa84dcca1d9282d60072905
#: d82dfba3364f456fbf90630310023e7b
msgid ""
"DGPS corrections give meter precision (free services) or decimeter precision"
" (paying services)"
msgstr "DGPS 校正可提供米级精度（免费服务）或分米级精度（付费服务）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:116
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:117
#: 0db944c49e8345d6a81690b7ad90360b 5e8dac7846b14d49ac7d0fb6e2b12bd2
#: 7e2a9b8c957547ffab2c84ac5843f837 aaa79415f1884bc2a4f689cad2a47dcf
#: c6f96ddc1fae4501953168f8f9e74ba7
msgid "RTK corrections"
msgstr "RTK 校正"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:119
#: 700de405f9504d379747432d8e6da7c0
msgid ""
"RTK corrections are using carrier phase informations and needs costly "
"advanced GPS as well as a RTK base station or a Network of RTK base stations"
" broadcasting corrections over a modem or Internet through the RTCM "
"protocol."
msgstr ""
"RTK 校正使用载波相位信息，需要昂贵的高级 GPS 以及 RTK 基站或通过调制解调器/互联网使用 RTCM 协议广播校正信号的 RTK 基站网络。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:126
#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:127
#: 11f562de3d6145e39bf80e618ac00a5b 2d9a0c2e53014141bf09a19ee3d86e60
#: 58136ebcf73f4e1181268c873d953245 bb7e4ed63ba94ccb8d9c1e73e7f0e6a9
#: f5aa2f364a60481eaf24ddfa121038f9
msgid ""
"RTK is easier to use with slow motion or static applications (like surveying"
" or farming) and give centimeter or millimeter precision."
msgstr "RTK 更适用于低速运动或静态应用（如测量或农业），可提供厘米甚至毫米级精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:28
#: 3bb119af28f44f128bee9caecd51e6be 894a27d7fa43450e86f106bf41e58d7e
#: b73b6cb444114cba83a557aac9d189b0 d97b7b2b19864f169c4848c784636527
msgid ""
"Some even more advanced GNSS receivers can combine DGPS and RTK corrections "
"and can receive other GNSS satellite constellations (GLONASS, GALILEO, SBAS,"
" Galileo, Beidou, IMES, QZSS, and/or NAVIC) and other channels (L2C, L5...) "
"at the same time to enhance precision and fix reliability."
msgstr ""
"一些更先进的 GNSS 接收机可以组合 DGPS 与 RTK 改正，并能同时接收其他 GNSS "
"卫星星座（GLONASS、GALILEO、SBAS、Galileo、Beidou、IMES、QZSS 和/或 "
"NAVIC）及其他频点（L2C、L5...），以提升精度和定位可靠性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:118
#: 06d0d57cf46b473ba0e4e9cda711a093 2aaaa693d3644443bb582ebb85589055
#: a193c5b29d824bab8c9b57836acefd84 b9594aadcd914f44ac944f2d183e4c0d
msgid ""
"RTK corrections are using carrier phase information and needs costly "
"advanced GPS as well as a RTK base station or a Network of RTK base stations"
" broadcasting corrections over a modem or Internet through the RTCM "
"protocol."
msgstr ""
"RTK 改正使用载波相位信息，需要昂贵的高级 GPS，以及一个 RTK 基站或一组 RTK 基站网络，通过调制解调器或互联网以 RTCM "
"协议播发改正数据。"
